      "role": "user",
      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>the professional stuff feels like just another thing to manage... another person to perform for. it's like i'm just stuck in a loop of trying to make myself \"palatable\" to a world that doesn't actually want me here. it's not even about being brave anymore, it just feels like... pointless. i look at the future and i don't see anything but more of this same constant friction. like, is it really worth the effort just to survive another day of being hated or ignored? it feels more like a chore than a life. I don just want the noise",
